    <a href="/papers/khronos.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>Khronos: A Type II Exovisor Architecture with WebAssembly</b></a><br />
    <span class="muted">2025. With Ajax Li. IEEE format, 9 pp.</span><br />
    A multi-tenant WebAssembly runtime that combines language-level sandboxing with exokernel-style
    capability gating and a custom <code>wasi:thread-spawn</code> dispatcher. ~5,000 lines of Rust;
    ~0.08 MiB per isolate (3x denser than Wasmtime, 18x denser than Docker); up to 6.7x speedup on
    dense matrix multiply while preserving per-tenant trap containment.<br />
